I am not sure what kind of plot you want to make,..but here is couple of examples:

dat <- data.frame(years=1949:1964,

 y=c(942,1003,1100,1234,1188,923,1289,1340,1445,1432,1523,1598,1600,1673, 1654,1722))

ggplot(data=dat, aes(x=years, y=y)) + geom_line()

ggplot(data=dat, aes(x=years, y=y)) + geom_line() + geom_point()

ggplot(data=dat, aes(x=years, y=y)) + geom_bar(stat = "identity")

--Kaori

