Hi Daniel,

The easy way is

d$predicted <- predict(gamlss(formula=r2~r1,family=NO,data=d))
ggplot(d,aes(r1,r2))+geom_point()+geom_smooth(aes(y=predicted), stat="identity")

Best,
Ista

