Hi,

Problem 1 is because you need to put stat="identity" outside the aes
call, like this:

geom_bar(data=testratings[testratings$rating<3,], aes(y=(-1)*percent),
stat="identity")

Problem 2 seems more difficult...

Best,
Ista

